<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmenistan Apr natgas output down 67 pct on Marc.</title>
<headline>Turkmenistan Apr natgas output down 67 pct on Marc.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's natural gas output fell in April to 0.89 billion cubic metres from 2.69 billion in March, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following figures for energy output in its latest monthly statistical bulletin.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes, except crude oil in million tonnes and natural gas in billion cubic meters.</p>
<p> TURKMEN ENERGY OUTPUT    April	  March     Jan-April 97</p>
<p> Natural gas		  0.887	  2.689	 10.983</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change     -67.0	  -25.0	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr pct change	  n/a	    n/a	  -27.3</p>
<p> Crude oil		    0.333	  0.338	  1.297</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change     -1.7	  +14.2	    n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr pct change	  n/a	    n/a	   +1.5</p>
<p> Gasoline		    41,900	 42,100	162,300</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change     -0.5	   +6.6	    n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	n/a	    n/a	  -39.0</p>
<p> Diesel			89,200	114,300	 392,600</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change    -22.0	  +24.1	     n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	n/a	    n/a	   -12.6</p>
<p> Fuel oil		   139,000	163,600	 577,300</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change    -15.0	  +21.7	     n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	n/a	    n/a	    +9.9</p>
<p>-- Almaty Newsroom +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
